<title>USA: Banco Mercantil FY96 net 34.89 bln bolivars.</title>
<headline>Banco Mercantil FY96 net 34.89 bln bolivars.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In millions of bolivars)</p>
<p>					1996	  1995*</p>
<p>Interest income		 168,316	109,713</p>
<p>Interest expenses		67,899	 59,738</p>
<p>Financial margin		100,417	 49,975</p>
<p>Operating expenses	     74,132	 39,205</p>
<p>Provisions			 15,289	  6,352</p>
<p>Other income		     27,329	 13,159</p>
<p>Other expenses		    3,434	  3,042</p>
<p>Net income			 34,891	 14,535</p>
<p>* Reclassified for comparison purposes.</p>
<p>NOTE: The bank is based in Caracas, Venezuela.</p>
<p>Net income for fiscal 1996 adjusted for inflation is 13.93 billion bolivars.</p>
</text>
